{
  "notes": "Downtempo electronica with a broken beat, D lydian, 96 BPM, swung sixteenths. A Casio-style string pad (CZ STRING) breathing on open voicings (3rd, 5th, 9th), a round FM bass that leaves space, the player's marimba on the Smart Keys (triplet echoes), and the AFRO kit: a displaced kick, a dry snare with ghosts, congas and a shaker. The lydian II chord (E major over D) is the floating colour. Scenes: A POWER ON holds Dmaj7; B SOFT LOOP turns Imaj7 II iii7 II; C DAYDREAM rises vi7 V II with the pad pulsing 3+3+2; D SLEEP MODE rests on vi7 Imaj7. ENERGY: pad and marimba, then kick and bass with the shaker, then the broken beat with congas, then sixteenths, fills and ratchets. All material is original.",
